Z||000007||count_iblis||10-11-2000||11:08 AM||||hello,<P>Im wanting to try to start a club in Kentucky and have been trying to for the last year now.  But conflicts with work, school, and a new baby  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  just didnt alow me two.  I moved the site from geocites to freesevers so dont let the counter fool you.   had almost 2500 hits in just a 9 month period.  If your interested you can go to <A HREF="http://www.kentuckyfieroclub.8m.com" TARGET=_blank>www.kentuckyfieroclub.8m.com</A>   if the club gets started maybe we can convince so us from louisville to meet you guys like half way in bowling green or something.  <P>chris||||reg||1
Z||000008||tgowens||10-12-2000||12:47 PM||||I was working on the formation of Classic Fiero Owners Group and several of you were interested. As I mentioned before, it was structured to cover OH, KY, TN, IN and WV and set up so that anyone could take part -- the web site was designed and can be viewed at  <A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/CFOG" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/CFOG</A>  -- however, I am now back in California and working at the Fiero Shop (as some of you may know - here we do restorations, engine swaps, etc. as well as sell parts and services..........I did recieve many emails of interest in the club and, as per the original idea, the club could be formed and run without my intervention if those who were interested desire to do so......I had no interest in being an officer of the club but rather would maintain the web site and help in the clubs formation......so, if anyone wants to take part and form the club and run it, feel free to email me and let me know...........for those who want to read the by-laws to decide if that is what they want, go to the "members only" page by using the userID of "guest" and the password of "guest" and read the by-laws...........keep me posted on whether you want to persue the organization of CFOG or not.......<P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/tgowens_sig.gif">                        <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A> - Blue '87 GT - Gold '87 GT||||reg||1
